# Mercury
# website: https://mercurylang.org
# docs: https://mercurylang.org/documentation/documentation.html
# description: Ignores Mercury compiler build directories, interface/optimization files, module maps, and compiled binaries.

# Build directory
Mercury/

# Module mapping and dependencies
Mercury.modules
*.d
*.dep
*.dv
*.date
*.date0
*.date3
*.c_date

# Interface and optimization files
*.int
*.int0
*.int2
*.int3
*.opt
*.trans_opt

# Compiler intermediate and error files
*.mh
*.init
*.err

# Target backend bytecode
*.beam
*.beams

# Compiled binaries and libraries
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.exe
*.out